WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.420
My car won't start. The battery is dead.

2
00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:11.820
Hello, I'm Maxime, the mechanic. I'll
test the battery, and I'll charge it.

3
00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.720
Can I drive to the château today?

4
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:21.360
Yes. First I charge the battery.
Then I check the alternator.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.300
You'll be on the road soon.
